OL,3,GNEWSAMet seizes 500 knives and arrests
OL,4,A266 in crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 260 people have been arrested
OL,7,Fand 500 knives taken off London's
OL,8,Fstreets during a crackdown on knife
OL,9,Fcrime, the Metropolitan Police said.
OL,11,FThe force said some of the capital's
OL,12,Fmost dangerous wanted offenders were
OL,13,Farrested during the operation, which
OL,14,Fran from 16 to 23 November.
OL,16,FOne suspect was charged with possession
OL,17,Foffences after 175 knives including
OL,18,Fflick knives, lock knives and machetes
OL,19,Fwere found during a search of two
OL,20,Faddresses in east London.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
