OL,3,GNEWSAMet seizes 500 knives and arrests
OL,4,A266 in crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met said of the 266 arrests made,
OL,7,F82 were being brought before the courts
OL,8,Fas priority suspects. "Every knife we
OL,9,Fseize is a weapon that can't be used to
OL,10,Fhurt someone," said Cmdr James Conway,
OL,11,Fthe force's lead for knife crime.
